<title>FINLAND: FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS 9-MTH OP PROFIT FIM 185.</title>
<headline>FINNISH SAVINGS BANKS 9-MTH OP PROFIT FIM 185.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to end September,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Operating profit after credit losses	 185 vs 161</p>
<p> Loan and guarantee losses			 59 vs 68</p>
<p> Net income from financial operations	 590 vs 567</p>
<p> Other income					 245 vs 214</p>
<p> Total income					 835 vs 782</p>
<p> Staff costs					  244 vs 239</p>
<p> Other costs					  304 vs 285</p>
<p> Depreciation					  27 vs 27</p>
<p> Credit losses					 59 vs 68</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures above include all savings banks and Aktia</p>
<p>Bank.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
